        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "It's Conker's birthday and someone crashed his party! The Evil Acorn has stolen all of Conker's presents and kidnapped his best chipmunk friend, Berri. Now you must take on the role of the bushy-tailed hero, pursuing your nemesis throughout 6 visually-stunning worlds to rescue Berri and save your birthday from complete disaster. Strain your brain to solve challenging puzzles, battle the Evil Acorn's horde of minions with your trusty slingshot, and even flex your muscles in sporting events as you track your foe to the final showdown!",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "¡Es el cumpleaños de Conker y alguien ha aguado la fiesta! La Bellota Malvada ha robado todos los regalos de Conker y ha secuestrado a su mejor amiga ardilla, Berri. Ahora debes ponerte en la piel del héroe de cola esponjosa y perseguir a tu archienemigo a través de 6 mundos visualmente espectaculares para rescatar a Berri y salvar tu cumpleaños de un desastre total. Exprime tu cerebro para resolver puzles complicados, combate contra la horda de secuaces de la Bellota Malvada con tu fiel tirachinas e incluso pon a prueba tus músculos en pruebas deportivas mientras sigues a tu enemigo hasta el enfrentamiento final.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
